{"id": "C2J6Xe5Ml-E", "title": "Video by gauravecomm", "description": "Finally, Another Client touched the $1.6M Year Mark with Insane ROAS\n\nHey Guys, Gaurav Ecom here:) Hope you had a phenomenal 2023 and a having a blasting 2024.\n\nToday, I will reveal some inner stuff that I never prefer to publicly share that helped me scale countless DTC brands to 6&7Figure run rates monthly.\n\nWhat's the secret?\n\nThe secret is not just how you run ads; it's a matter of how you differentiate your brand message to your customers to make them understand this is the right product they could not find in the market that can solve their problem. Still, it would be best to show your Core Differentiator that pushes them to trust you. \n\nIt's a matter of bringing trust and credibility into customers' minds; they are ready to pay you.\n\nPlus, using different marketing angles while using ads, which I mentioned below, will help you change the way of marketing you market your products, and you will notice ads start skyrocketing :)\n\nCreatives Scripts Ideas:\n\n- 5 Logical Reasons to Trust Your Product + High-End CTA (Not Shop Now or Order Now)\n\n- Testimonial Mashups (Illustrating their experience after using your product and the results they got; it will be more relatable)\n\n- Brand Story ( Mission of Your brand just like quality cosmetics at affordability)\n\n- Intro Video with Product + 5CoreDiffrentiators + Testimonials + End CTA \n\n- Problem Based ( Pain Point + Testimonial + Your Product+ End Cta)\n\n- Core Diffrentiator BulletPoints Based Creative ( Your Product Compared to Other Brands) \n\nThis detailed explanation of creatives will help you scale your products effectively while using your marketing budget wisely!\n\nLet me know if you need more help. I would be happy to help everyone here, too:)\n\nAlso, let me know if I missed something so we can mutually help everyone here!\n\nLove you all. - I am 100% committed to you guys this year, just like last year.\n\n#ecommerc